OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, with complex needs
OL,4,Ahoused 240 miles away from family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a girl with complex needs
OL,7,Fface a 480-mile (772km) round trip to
OL,8,Fvisit her in residential care due to a
OL,9,Flack of available accommodation.
OL,11,FSophie McNab, 13, was placed in a
OL,12,Ffull-time facility in Annan, Dumfries
OL,13,Fand Galloway during the summer ` a
OL,14,Ffive-hour drive from her home in
OL,15,FInverness.
OL,17,FHer father Iain and stepmother Jaime
OL,18,Fsaid no alternative was available
OL,19,Flocally and one of them would have had
OL,20,Fto give up work to look after Sophie,
OL,21,Fwho is non-verbal.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
