OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 13, with complex needs
OL,4,Ahoused 240 miles away from family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Highland Council
OL,7,Fsaid the local authority "recognised
OL,8,Fthe difficulty" posed to Sophie's
OL,9,Ffamily, but expanded accommodation
OL,10,Fwould not be ready until next autumn.
